<p>Hits the target with your shield, doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">102%, 111%, 118%, 124%, 130%</acronym> damage. If it hits, you follow up with two automatic critical hits with your weapon, doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">102%, 111%, 118%, 124%, 130%</acronym> base damage each.</p>